      "date": "2026-05-06T11:40:19.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings: EPS and revenues miss analyst expectations",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹117 (up from ₹106 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹2.92t (up 12% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹160.8b (up 10% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 5.5% (down from 5.6% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue missed analyst estimates by 1.4%. Earnings per share (EPS) also missed analyst estimates by 7.5%. Revenue is forecast to grow 12% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Construction industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 15% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year.",
