      "date": "2026-01-12T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Larsen & Toubro Limited (BSE:500510) entered into a share purchase agreement to acquire remaining 40% stake in L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited from Sapura Nautical Power PTE. Ltd. for INR 1.2 billion.",
      "body": "Larsen & Toubro Limited (BSE:500510) entered into a share purchase agreement to acquire remaining 40% stake in L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited from Sapura Nautical Power PTE. Ltd. for INR 1.2 billion on January 12, 2026. A cash consideration valued at INR 19.26 per share will be paid by Larsen & Toubro Limited. As part of consideration, an undisclosed value is paid towards common equity of L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited. In addition, L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited would repay fully the shareholders’ loan outstanding aggregating INR 1,526.61 million to Sapura. Upon completion, Larsen & Toubro Limited will own 120% stake in L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, L&T Sapura Shipping Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 1.54 billion.\n",
